{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17209190","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17209190","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1720919001:1":{"text":"Good day, sir. I'm Haria, an intern reporter with the Savannah Morning Post. I'm doing a survey.","source_cn":"这位先生，日安。我是《赛凡纳晨报》的实习记者赫蒂奇，正...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x191F5A562A6A8796","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1720919002:1":{"text":"A reporter? Doing a survey?","source_cn":"啊？记者？社会调查？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5C8E5CCB3E88A1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1720919003:1":{"text":"Yes! Have you seen anyone suspicious around Viscount Demit's manor lately?","source_cn":"是的！请问您最近在德米特子爵府邸周围，有没有见过什么可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC14AE8DC76CC4C43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1720919004:1":{"text":"Suspicious how?","source_cn":"可疑的人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45C5F3FC84F58B77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1720919005:1":{"text":"Like... anyone lurking around and asking too many questions? Or a stranger showing up out of nowhere, claiming to be some long-lost relative? Or maybe someone in a disguise, someone who clearly didn't belong there, but kept hanging around anyway?","source_cn":"比如，有没有那种鬼鬼祟祟、四处探听消息的神秘人？或者，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C2CDE3247CAF7BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1720919006:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1720919007:1":{"text":"Please think carefully. Has anyone asked about the viscount's schedule? Or shown an unusual interest in his manor's security?","source_cn":"您仔细想想，有没有人向您打听过德米特子爵的日常起居？或...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8CF6E1F4EF1883A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1720919008:1":{"text":"Why are you asking me all this, miss?","source_cn":"小姐，你问这些做什么？又是探听消息，又是乔装打扮……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8D316CBD223C7E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1720919009:1":{"text":"You keep talking about suspicious people... But honestly, you're the one sounding suspicious right now.","source_cn":"我看……你就挺可疑的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A0B82EF01C0EA3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1720919010:1":{"text":"What? No, no, that's not... I'm just asking! It's for an article!","source_cn":"哎？！我、我不是……我只是在做调查！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8B25E403D03126E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1720919011:1":{"text":"Right. That's what they all say. Stay away from me, or I'll call the guards!","source_cn":"哼，现在的骗子花样可真多。离我远点！不然我就叫守备军了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28FF7BB293C83541","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:实习记者赫蒂奇":{"text":"Intern Haria","source":"实习记者赫蒂奇","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:谨慎的管家":{"text":"Cautious Butler","source":"谨慎的管家","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":12,"localized_text_count":11,"speaker_count":2}}